[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Hopper on FreeBSD supports LLVM mode only. Build the target library
with hopper-clang, then compile and fuzz it:

  CC=hopper-clang CXX=hopper-clang++ ./configure && make
  hopper compile --header ./foo.h --library ./libfoo.so --output output
  hopper fuzz output --func-pattern 'foo_*'

"hopper compile" builds a harness with cargo from the sources and
vendored crates in %%DATADIR%%; it needs no network access.

Hopper exchanges coverage through System V shared memory. Inside a jail,
start the jail with sysvshm=new.
EOM
}
]
